{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golftacular! is mini-golf\u2026. barely. Mix party game chaos and dumb fun with precision and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014530/extras/ba91a1849bd4115f6ae04570e4a7b325.webp?t=1757961663\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo learn the ropes of \u201cGolftacular!\u201d with up to 4 players taking turns as Tortillo, Chuck, Papa, and Poop, in item fueled multiplayer golf madness across 2 of the 8 tours. Or take things at your own pace and sharpen your skills while earning stars and collecting medallions in the first 10 levels of the single player puzzle mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match items to create your own powerful and unique combos for game breaking shots. Turn the course into your personal parkour playground or an obstacle-filled nightmare for your opponents. Call in airstrikes, play rock-paper-scissors, give your ball wings, place portals\u2026 and that\u2019s just the tip of the iceberg.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two full golf tours</strong> - Try a bite sized version of the full experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Preview the puzzles</strong> - Tackle challenging courses alone in single player puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items, Items, Items</strong> - Learn to use items for game breaking abilities and combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014530/extras/ba91a1849bd4115f6ae04570e4a7b325.webp?t=1757961663\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014530?t=1757961663","background_raw":"https://shared.akam